        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "fcJz7",
          "name": "Invariants",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "cornerRadius": 8,
          "stroke": "#D9E0E7",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tbHSf",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "content": "不变量",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 20,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "N68jC",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1.  平台流水：settled_amount ≤ matched_amount ≤ expected_amount，金额均为正",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "s4LBH",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2.  一条账单行最多匹配一笔平台流水；一笔平台流水被多行覆盖时合计不超过 expected_amount",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "maNgV",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3.  账单 RECONCILED 后不得再改匹配、实际费用或归类；纠错只经 billing 追加调整事实",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Wpgxu",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4.  净额只在同一清算账户同一账单内抵销；cash_direction = NONE 的账单不生成预期银行流水",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DXZS5",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5.  同一银行流水的 CONFIRMED 匹配按方向带符号求和不超过流水金额，且同一银行账户；确认事务锁该流水",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "V5sVJS",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6.  同一预期银行流水 CONFIRMED 合计不超过 expected_amount；一个异常最多一条 APPLIED 处置且完整覆盖差额",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Uqg19",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7.  只暂记借方流水；SUSPENDED 流水只能经 CLASSIFY 重分类；CLASSIFY 的入账路径由来源对象决定",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "C3HU5u",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "#1F2933",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "8.  银行对账单期初 + 流水 = 期末，否则不得导入；事务内只写本库，正常匹配不查询 Payment",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
