        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "wiJy4",
          "name": "Rules",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 20,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Apyjl",
              "name": "匹配规则（按优先级）",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#EAF2FB",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uc4I4",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F5FAD",
                  "content": "匹配规则（按优先级）",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yDxT6",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1.  键：清算账户 + 引用类型 + 外部交易号，命中唯一 OPEN / PARTIALLY_MATCHED 明细",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ksJGQ",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2.  方向一致：PAYMENT 行 ↔ 应收；REFUND / CHARGEBACK 行 ↔ 应付",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZcSEc",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3.  金额相等 → MATCHED；小于 → PARTIALLY_MATCHED；大于 → AMOUNT_MISMATCH",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EKoRW",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4.  未命中先等待（默认 3 天，按清算账户配置），期满 → CHANNEL_LINE_UNMATCHED",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M9TMi",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5.  命中多条 → AMBIGUOUS_REFERENCE，不猜测",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "U074IU",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "6.  FEE / ADJUSTMENT 行：能归属则成本分配，否则 UNEXPLAINED_ADJUSTMENT",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "DI2Tu",
              "name": "批次对平门禁（全部满足才 RECONCILED）",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#EAF6EE",
              "cornerRadius": 8,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Im92U",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#2F7D4F",
                  "content": "批次对平门禁（全部满足才 RECONCILED）",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y68sXi",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1.  每条 PAYMENT / REFUND / CHARGEBACK 行都被匹配完整覆盖",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "B5CLOd",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2.  每条 FEE / ADJUSTMENT 行都被成本分配或已批准处置完整覆盖",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Tj3aY",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3.  本批没有阻塞性的开放异常",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pnngl",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "4.  锁内复核：各行按方向回放 = 批次头总额、费用、扣项、净额",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vXA6g",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "#1F2933",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "5.  对平后不得再追加改变金额的匹配 / 分配 / 处置；纠错只能经 billing 追加调整事实",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
